{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"102492a0bbc2d925","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f2846011df78cea4","title":"在Linux部分，我们要学习命令。&nbsp;也就是用命令代替之前的可视化界面。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"102492a0bbc2d925","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6ffac9b1fd359811","title":"要尽快熟悉一下指令。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"102492a0bbc2d925","children":[{"parent":"62792b183a27e0ff","children":[],"id":"713e7c374c77897b","title":"VMware/ubuntu/xshell/vimplus"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62792b183a27e0ff","title":"软件"},{"parent":"102492a0bbc2d925","children":[{"parent":"9b861129ddd60dd0","children":[],"id":"5358eb67e2509384","title":"1.输密码的时候看不到密码。甚至连 *都没有回显"},{"parent":"9b861129ddd60dd0","children":[],"id":"1ba6325d9c3056ea","title":"2.没有消息就是最好的消息。&nbsp;如果输入一条命令，没有得到反馈，说明它成功了。&nbsp;<br>如果有反馈，可能是出错了，看一下反馈信息"},{"parent":"9b861129ddd60dd0","children":[],"id":"9cc70042b5e86739","title":"3.&nbsp;在shell里面。&nbsp;可以使用&nbsp; tab&nbsp;进行补全。<br>会对一些没有争议的路径名补全"},{"parent":"9b861129ddd60dd0","children":[{"parent":"4627976a6e1ba3e1","children":[],"id":"2609208f938fab81","title":"刚开始多练习一下命令。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"4627976a6e1ba3e1","children":[],"id":"9c6f29f7c2504346","title":"ctrl + r&nbsp;是搜索命令，之前输入过的命令，可以搜索。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4627976a6e1ba3e1","title":"4.上下键可以上一次输入的命令。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b861129ddd60dd0","title":"Linux的注意事项"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"102492a0bbc2d925","title":"概述"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"1728361c3bc46624","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2304f02f7314be13","title":"帮助命令，我们可以用它看命令。看系统调用（Linux内核对外提供的函数，用来完成特定功能的）。也可以看库函数<br>"},{"parent":"1728361c3bc46624","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"89071285fb6fbb54","title":"一定要知道卷1代表的是命令；&nbsp;卷2代表的是系统调用；&nbsp;卷3代表库函数"},{"parent":"1728361c3bc46624","children":[{"parent":"0c567174c7b89c68","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"aea39a0162301b5d","title":"首先是Name，主要是一个极简概括"},{"parent":"0c567174c7b89c68","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ed9e61164f9bccdc","title":"SYNOPSIS。头文件，&nbsp;函数声明"},{"parent":"0c567174c7b89c68","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"46db9acc23c3a4ab","title":"DESCRIPTION：&nbsp;详细描述<br>"},{"parent":"0c567174c7b89c68","children":[],"id":"41bcdde9dc6c2547","title":"RETURN&nbsp;值：&nbsp;描述自己的返回值是什么含义"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0c567174c7b89c68","title":"man命令关注信息"},{"parent":"1728361c3bc46624","children":[],"id":"96e3bc8b6acb8b5d","title":"一定要会用，这个是后续学函数的基础。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"1728361c3bc46624","title":"man命令"},{"parent":"root","customWidth":95,"children":[{"parent":"c370feb863b081e0","children":[{"parent":"b9ff9a1ec17a59fd","children":[],"id":"08c89f93480e1396","title":"Linux的权限是比较严的。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b9ff9a1ec17a59fd","title":"Linux系统可以同时有多个用户，登录上一台Linux。&nbsp;<br>Linux是一个多用户的系统。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c370feb863b081e0","children":[{"parent":"da0cb2c0b4802fe2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"07eeac60fef13b0d","title":"root用户：&nbsp;最高权限的用户。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"da0cb2c0b4802fe2","children":[{"parent":"368b38f953bddcdd","children":[],"id":"4f61ca53c9de49d5","title":"建议学习的时候，使用普通用户。&nbsp;如果遇到了权限问题，再解决权限问题。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"368b38f953bddcdd","title":"普通用户：平常用的时候，用普通用户。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"da0cb2c0b4802fe2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"82f57e9a9f4fd6c5","title":"sudo用户。就是可以让自己执行命令的时候，假装自己是管理员。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"da0cb2c0b4802fe2","title":"用户的分类"},{"parent":"c370feb863b081e0","children":[{"parent":"2792b6b447f68761","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"268150a67f4b9aaf","title":"家目录就是一个目录。你进到这个目录之后，权限会非常的友好。&nbsp;<br>家目录是分用户的，你只能回自己家。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2792b6b447f68761","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ba5b30d086e2afe6","title":"对于root用户。它的家目录就是 /root"},{"parent":"2792b6b447f68761","children":[{"parent":"b23a31c56091b222","children":[],"id":"d5512a595d28a6ac","title":"家目录不是 /home"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b23a31c56091b222","title":"对于非root用户。家目录就是 /home/{username}<br>对于zhou用户，&nbsp;家目录就是 /home/zhou"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"2792b6b447f68761","title":"家目录强调一下"},{"parent":"c370feb863b081e0","children":[{"parent":"5950cf3c0265663c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"79cbcae077c2175c","title":"对于用户的增删改查"},{"parent":"5950cf3c0265663c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2f491be794d7137c","title":"添加用户，查看用户，删除用户，设置密码，切换用户<br>自己练一下。&nbsp;<br>如果在工作中，碰到了这种实际的需求，查一下命令"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5950cf3c0265663c","title":"这个命令自己练习一下，&nbsp;但是工作时候用的很少。&nbsp;<br>但是自己学习的时候有时候会用到。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c370feb863b081e0","title":"用户子系统"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"0039fd8f73fd202b","children":[{"parent":"7b8d9d4664b4934c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"da6d25445bcc91de","title":"1.windows的路径，是一个森林结构。 C&nbsp; D E<br>Linux里面，是树状的。&nbsp; &nbsp; /"},{"parent":"7b8d9d4664b4934c","children":[{"parent":"ec9c31434bc539fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"039f751ec67995e5","title":"在windows中，基本是以文件夹的形式组织一个软件的。&nbsp;<br>比如，装一个qq，&nbsp;将这个qq的所有文件全部放在一个大文件夹中。"},{"parent":"ec9c31434bc539fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4861df6b4aa2d2a2","title":"在Linux里面，是按照类别来的。&nbsp;比如要装qq，&nbsp;会将启动的命令放在一个集中的文件夹中，<br>配置会放在另外的一个文件夹中；如果要装wps，类似"},{"parent":"ec9c31434bc539fe","children":[],"id":"0e61b4971ea802b9","title":"启动命令、配置文件、库"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ec9c31434bc539fe","title":"2.软件组织方式不一样"},{"parent":"7b8d9d4664b4934c","children":[{"parent":"70a77be4b43c6ede","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"27c73715ee73301e","title":"/bin：&nbsp;存储可执行程序和脚本的<br>/usr/bin"},{"parent":"70a77be4b43c6ede","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3d94c1e776c7ba7c","title":"/etc:&nbsp;配置文件的"},{"parent":"70a77be4b43c6ede","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a9aea165a55bfb4a","title":"/lib：系统库文件"},{"parent":"70a77be4b43c6ede","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8b3986b7c40f4e22","title":"/root"},{"parent":"70a77be4b43c6ede","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"27603c37a7748a99","title":"/home/{username}"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"70a77be4b43c6ede","title":"一些比较重要的"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7b8d9d4664b4934c","title":"组织方式不一样"},{"parent":"0039fd8f73fd202b","children":[{"parent":"2184781cd75b842d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ee3eeb92d80120ab","title":"软盘、机械盘、固态盘。真实文件组织是否一样？不一样。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2184781cd75b842d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3eb79a7b1073f53b","title":"虚拟文件系统：&nbsp;就是一套虚拟的文件系统。使用这个虚拟文件系统，可以映射到不同的盘上。&nbsp;<br>/home/zhou/2.txt。&nbsp;对于用户来说，不需要关心是什么盘。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2184781cd75b842d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"708e690205a7e7e8","title":"树就是我们所说的虚拟文件系统。使用它可以帮助我们统一，我们也不需要关心真实的物理存储方式。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2184781cd75b842d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"374fa443f368bad1","title":"虚拟文件系统，就是一个逻辑关系，维护这个逻辑关系，这个逻辑关系最终会有一个对应。<br>虚拟文件系统，最终会真实对应到物理文件系统上去。"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"2184781cd75b842d","title":"虚拟文件系统"},{"parent":"0039fd8f73fd202b","children":[{"parent":"2d4645a3362149bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9c767fd1fd258f5b","title":"这个叫做硬链接"},{"parent":"2d4645a3362149bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"710697c934c9de0e","title":"硬链接数也需要理解"},{"parent":"2d4645a3362149bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c4c26ac3e0f4a889","title":"硬链接的使用：&nbsp;创建一个 1.txt文件。里面写一些内容<br>创建一个硬链接，"},{"parent":"2d4645a3362149bd","children":[{"parent":"96abf264da6f06b6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"96a3a14a9db114c3","title":"对于文件，比较容易理解。&nbsp;创建一个文件，硬链接数就是1"},{"parent":"96abf264da6f06b6","children":[{"parent":"5001745ec58d049b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"224bccf05fdf0bef","title":"背景： 对于新建任意一个文件夹，里面自带两个文件夹。&nbsp;<br>.&nbsp; ..<br>.对应的是当前文件夹； ..对应的是上一级文件夹"},{"parent":"5001745ec58d049b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"af7ffe9ab940b0a9","title":"创建一个test1文件夹。 test1自己是指向自己的。 （硬链接数+1）<br>里面，自带 .&nbsp; &nbsp;..&nbsp; &nbsp;; .指向当前目录（硬链接数 +1）"},{"parent":"5001745ec58d049b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e203e1debc7bf6f7","title":"如果在test1里面，再建一个test2。&nbsp;这时候。 test2<br>test1的硬链接数，会变成3。&nbsp;原因是&nbsp; test2里面有个 ..。&nbsp;指向test1"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5001745ec58d049b","title":"对于文件夹，创建一个文件夹，硬链接数是多少"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"96abf264da6f06b6","title":"硬链接数的计算"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2d4645a3362149bd","title":"虚拟文件系统到物理文件系统之间其实存在映射"},{"parent":"0039fd8f73fd202b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"848d55ac4f23b7ff","title":"真实存储的物理文件系统上，还有一个叫做inode的结点，用以存储一些信息，比如文件的权限、大小、时间戳<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0039fd8f73fd202b","title":"Linux文件系统"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"87e05bc5db8fb4ee","title":"之前我们在windows下，都是可视化的。但是现在Linux下都是命令行，所以我们要学会用命令行看目录。<br>创目录、删目录"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"5eb92b0e3f712ee0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6581c049848c56ae","title":"pwd"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5eb92b0e3f712ee0","title":"查看当前目录"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6b2e8e211ed4ea9a","title":"cd&nbsp;进入某个目录"},{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[{"parent":"affa8c3df68dfa6f","children":[],"id":"cd88be9d76cb1fb4","title":"回家目录。回这个用户对应的家目录"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"affa8c3df68dfa6f","title":"cd ~"},{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c43ca9140205697e","title":"cd&nbsp;相对路径/绝对路径"},{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1b372e6948d53201","title":"..用的比较多"},{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"739fbefbdeb41b4f","title":"~&nbsp;代表的是家目录。&nbsp;用的很多。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"9fca74732c63bc5e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"50c492afeb0e84ff","title":"可以写相对路径，也可以写绝对路径&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9fca74732c63bc5e","title":"改变当前目录"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"bd511c039ee78966","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f46bbf833b66be30","title":"mkdir创建目录。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"bd511c039ee78966","children":[],"id":"ac9dd25b700f8dab","title":"只能创建单级目录。&nbsp;如果要创建多级目录。 -p"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"bd511c039ee78966","title":"创建目录"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fa0defbfaad6363c","title":"ls：&nbsp;重要"},{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"98fbf42f8becc42d","title":"ls&nbsp;单写的时候，显示的是当前目录有哪些内容。<br>ls&nbsp;后可以跟相对路径，也可以跟绝对路径"},{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4363cc16f9c00505","title":"ls&nbsp;目录：就是显示该目录下的内容"},{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[{"parent":"84f9ac7d75015394","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ab7a0e965ce3f71a","title":"表示显示所有的文件，包括隐藏的。&nbsp;在Linux里面， .开头也是隐藏的。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"84f9ac7d75015394","title":"-a选项"},{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"35bf1296ad305b8a","title":"第一列表示它的类型。&nbsp;是个文件，还是文件夹。&nbsp;<br>-表示是文件； d表示是目录"},{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[{"parent":"5d3849b5fde14abb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"67197e7d415d33bb","title":"其实表示的是给三类人的权限。&nbsp;第一个rwx，表示的是给自己的权限。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"5d3849b5fde14abb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a772c29ae561a20a","title":"第一个表示的是自己的权限。&nbsp;<br>第二个表示的是给同组人的<br>第三个表示的是给其他人的权限"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5d3849b5fde14abb","title":"后面9个字符，表示的是权限。&nbsp;<br>rwx:&nbsp;表示读权限，写权限，执行权限<br>"},{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9d2739253bc91757","title":"硬链接数"},{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"eb7f57fbb6560e4a","title":"文件的所有者<br>文件的所有组"},{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[{"parent":"1b95a1fc19156fcd","children":[],"id":"de20ed764746cf9c","title":"h human&nbsp;以人类更友好的方式显示。会换单位<br>ls -alh"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1b95a1fc19156fcd","title":"文件的大小"},{"parent":"487c0086e34a563d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"48362220b39b5c46","title":"-l选项中的所有内容都要记住。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"487c0086e34a563d","title":"-l选项。&nbsp;非常重要<br>要知道显示的内容的含义"},{"parent":"d7debc1197763c40","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9731234d0125af9c","title":"查看这里用的最多的： <br>ll<br>ls -al"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d7debc1197763c40","title":"查看目录"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"12509950c78e9428","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b84f61bfc0d2702c","title":"cp test1.txt&nbsp; test2.txt&nbsp;"},{"parent":"12509950c78e9428","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1c80a44ff183e66","title":"cp test1.txt dir"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"12509950c78e9428","title":"复制文件"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"bbf3c0751baccb59","children":[],"id":"a1fc31302977faad","title":"mv&nbsp; test1.txt test2.txt<br>mv test1.txt dir"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"bbf3c0751baccb59","title":"移动文件"},{"parent":"424db45ee68ed179","children":[{"parent":"c67aff134798446a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"13ff564b6599628c","title":"rm&nbsp;需要注意一下。&nbsp;删除文件或文件夹<br>如果需要删除的是文件夹，需要加 -r<br>如果需要强制删，加-f<br>"},{"parent":"c67aff134798446a","children":[],"id":"7d3b954294bf8727","title":"rm&nbsp; test1.txt<br>rm -r test1<br>rm -rf test2"},{"parent":"c67aff134798446a","children":[{"parent":"6d280d99a9dd043d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c778e338e3de9d90","title":"rm -rf test1"},{"parent":"6d280d99a9dd043d","children":[],"id":"92e065b0ec87f6c4","title":"sudo rm -rf /"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"6d280d99a9dd043d","title":"删除的时候一定要小心"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c67aff134798446a","title":"删除文件"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"424db45ee68ed179","title":"目录相关命令"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"40cbdaf59e444838","children":[{"parent":"b6268b5acab5a00e","children":[{"parent":"64db7cb422002aed","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3a3ba2228a0c9eea","title":"目录就是个文件。&nbsp;这个文件里面装的东西比较特殊。&nbsp;<br>装的是这个文件夹里面的，&nbsp;名字，inode编号。<br>目录项（文件夹中的子文件的特殊名字）"},{"parent":"64db7cb422002aed","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"276b139ec85becb7","title":"Linux里面，万物皆文件。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"64db7cb422002aed","title":"目录是什么东西"},{"parent":"b6268b5acab5a00e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"351f813b76cd9f7e","title":"权限分三个 。rwx<br>读、写、执行"},{"parent":"b6268b5acab5a00e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"19000293a37c0963","title":"对于一个目录来说，一定要有x权限。&nbsp;否则其他权限都用不了。<br>是一个基础权限。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"b6268b5acab5a00e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"175191c05ed5201e","title":"r权限就是能够读目录项。&nbsp;或者说，展示目录下有哪些文件或者文件夹<br>"},{"parent":"b6268b5acab5a00e","children":[{"parent":"731fb0207febbfad","children":[],"id":"0c9dd8d588d33723","title":"修改某个文件的内容，只需要文件的写权限。不需要目录的写权限。<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"731fb0207febbfad","title":"w权限，就是修改目录项的权限。&nbsp;比如在这个文件夹下新增&nbsp;文件，新增文件夹，删除文件，删除文件夹。移动文件<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b6268b5acab5a00e","title":"目录权限"},{"parent":"40cbdaf59e444838","children":[{"parent":"b2f4cd53ee6d3173","children":[{"parent":"99339890957474aa","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9b6e2056698570fb","title":"有r权限，能看文件的内容"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"99339890957474aa","title":"r权限"},{"parent":"b2f4cd53ee6d3173","children":[{"parent":"fd6400c323618408","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6480ce33d8650f1d","title":"w权限，就是写文件的内容。允许修改"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fd6400c323618408","title":"w&nbsp;权限<br>"},{"parent":"b2f4cd53ee6d3173","children":[{"parent":"27d2b1c9639be664","children":[],"id":"b101c3d87a2caa39","title":"可执行权限，如果没有x权限，不能运行这个文件"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"27d2b1c9639be664","title":"x权限"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b2f4cd53ee6d3173","title":"文件权限"},{"parent":"40cbdaf59e444838","children":[{"parent":"966423b06d39e393","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"015ff3a219df6c43","title":"chmod&nbsp; &nbsp;权限&nbsp; 目录名/文件名"},{"parent":"966423b06d39e393","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2dfedc03f72d6144","title":"我们使用数字表示法。分别使用 4&nbsp; 2 1&nbsp;表示 r权限。 w权限。 x权限<br>"},{"parent":"966423b06d39e393","children":[],"id":"cc9cfdfb9ea9f6dc","title":"chmod&nbsp; 777 1.txt<br>chmod&nbsp; 765 1.txt<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"966423b06d39e393","title":"设置权限"},{"parent":"40cbdaf59e444838","children":[],"id":"067464e13c9f6b4d","title":"权限掩码"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"40cbdaf59e444838","title":"权限问题"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"940f6916a6d71a37","children":[{"parent":"df15659ad7772314","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"12445a52b8056c3d","title":"touch 2.txt"},{"parent":"df15659ad7772314","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-size":"18px"},"id":"0fecb378a967c950","title":"echo \"111\" &gt;1.txt<br>echo \"2222\" &gt;&gt;1.txt<br>"},{"parent":"df15659ad7772314","children":[{"parent":"f4538e423c79d3b7","children":[],"id":"fb1a9b053680a05a","title":"如果文件不存在，直接创建这个文件。<br>如果文件存在，会编辑文件"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f4538e423c79d3b7","title":"vim test1.txt"},{"parent":"df15659ad7772314","children":[{"parent":"fb079881055f4ab4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"65bf352577192f5f","title":"使用&nbsp;vim 1.txt&nbsp;<br>创建或者说打开一个 1.txt的文件。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"fb079881055f4ab4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d2d41219af7c4ed2","title":"进入了之后。&nbsp;点 i&nbsp;进入插入模式。&nbsp;这时候从键盘输入的内容能够进去<br>"},{"parent":"fb079881055f4ab4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4c567c4d9b5a65cb","title":"等到写完之后。 esc键退出插入模式。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"fb079881055f4ab4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4fb7af440332444f","title":"输入冒号。wq&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>w就是写入。 q就是退出。&nbsp; 也就是保存并退出<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fb079881055f4ab4","title":"vim的超基础使用"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"df15659ad7772314","title":"创建文件"},{"parent":"940f6916a6d71a37","children":[{"parent":"75194ce571dfdaf4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ac3ce737071b47f8","title":"$ find /usr/include -name \"stdio.h\"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;# 在/usr/include目录下查找stdio.h文件<br>$ find .&nbsp; -name \"*.c\"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; # 在当前工作目录下查找所有以.c结尾的文件<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"75194ce571dfdaf4","title":"查找文件<br>就是按照文件名、类型来找"},{"parent":"940f6916a6d71a37","children":[{"parent":"f1fa6832aa7b1f30","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c95ef45df7085748","title":"cat了解一下"},{"parent":"f1fa6832aa7b1f30","children":[{"parent":"b039eb2e47d125bc","children":[],"id":"f9f9f85ddcfdc5fa","title":"tail&nbsp;尾部<br>head<br>less"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b039eb2e47d125bc","title":"tail&nbsp;要注意一下。&nbsp;有时候有用。&nbsp;可以实时查看日志文件<br>tail -100f error.log<br>对于日志的一些追加写入，可以实时显示到页面"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1fa6832aa7b1f30","title":"查看文件内容"},{"parent":"940f6916a6d71a37","children":[{"parent":"d9bbdaa715f34ec0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"28cf4bc55cf58144","title":"搜索文件的内容"},{"parent":"d9bbdaa715f34ec0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"37a0549682cccdc8","title":"grep&nbsp; -nE \"要搜索的内容\"&nbsp;文件<br>n：&nbsp;显示行号。&nbsp;方便后续找它。<br>E:&nbsp;正则&nbsp;<br>C:&nbsp;上下多显示几行<br>grep -nEC10 \"要搜索的内容\"&nbsp;文件"},{"parent":"d9bbdaa715f34ec0","children":[{"parent":"8ca215cd2730a020","children":[],"id":"c2bbd3048d917b6b","title":"模式匹配。&nbsp;<br>比如，我想判断一个字符串，是不是邮箱"},{"parent":"8ca215cd2730a020","children":[{"parent":"0ef356b948b8f8b5","children":[],"id":"e6934de32f764ba0","title":"100000@qq.com"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ef356b948b8f8b5","title":"email&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8ca215cd2730a020","children":[{"parent":"05b01d0d8fcbd256","children":[],"id":"4f70126ab6ceeb8e","title":"位数。&nbsp;<br>123456789101"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05b01d0d8fcbd256","title":"手机号"},{"parent":"8ca215cd2730a020","children":[],"id":"c3d31df14d41d968","title":"比如，我要在C程序中，判断一个输入，是否符合email的规则。&nbsp;是否符合手机号的规则。&nbsp;<br>怎么判断一下？"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ca215cd2730a020","title":"什么是正则"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d9bbdaa715f34ec0","title":"搜索文件"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"940f6916a6d71a37","title":"文件相关命令"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"0e3edf589ba6405d","children":[],"id":"3b9a6a2a0bd806d0","title":"shell命令是可以组合的。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"0e3edf589ba6405d","children":[{"parent":"846bcc153f0c14f4","children":[],"id":"cc55485856281740","title":"mkdir test1 ; cd test1<br>先执行cmd1，再执行cmd2."}],"collapsed":true,"id":"846bcc153f0c14f4","title":"cmd1 ; cmd2"},{"parent":"0e3edf589ba6405d","children":[{"parent":"8b7fecb5fced0181","children":[],"id":"9c87211293cf5e7b","title":"将cmd1的输出结果，作为cmd2的输入"},{"parent":"8b7fecb5fced0181","children":[],"id":"a46e917614ca5dd3","title":"wc -l"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b7fecb5fced0181","title":"cmd1 | cmd2&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e3edf589ba6405d","title":"命令的组合"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\